  <item>
    <title>DS005：为什么《后室》是Prada的恐怖双生子</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a6353fc6356eb2d9be7d80a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a6353fc6356eb2d9be7d80a</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 12:07:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>亲爱的听众友友们，你们爷爷奶奶关注的时装播客终于更新了！</span></p><p></p><p><span>《后室》这部现象级恐怖片横空出世之后，已经有许多播客详细剖析过它的来龙去脉以及阈限空间相关的概念。但本期节目将提出一个刁钻的角度：一个由黄墙纸、旧地毯和日光灯组成的无限办公室，为什么会让人觉得高级时髦，甚至强烈地联想到Prada？</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">01:43</a> 《后室》与Prada的中间人：Rem Koolhaas</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="453">07:33</a> Rem Koolhaas和Miuccia Prada本质上都很拧巴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="667">11:07</a> 传奇毒舌檄文《Junkspace》（《垃圾空间》），骂得也太脏了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="979">16:19</a> Prada Epicenter店是垃圾空间理念的实体化</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm3u-Qtz9W0-e3a8MacOUz899ueE.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoWoHftIOy5GG5MX6vdH-dcLMHq0.png"><p><em><span> Prada Epicenter震中店</span></em></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a> Prada的“丑时髦”理念：精心策划的平庸</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FghNUG9PM3t_TaLM-PLkoOv2I6AL.png"><p><em><span> Prada尼龙包</span></em></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu3G6KVbxfGIWrY3UZiJ3zKiw7ud.png"><p><em><span> Prada SS 1996</span></em></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnfPJr9rrXhLn4MAcVad8pnqaUQG.png"><p><em><span> Prada SS 2011</span></em></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn31GWxavIOsueZZo4fE0kNiCw8r.png"><p><em><span>Prada FW 2008</span></em></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1972">32:52</a> 极致的平庸是品味的金矿</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi5pCG3m0phZUWO9rBXAqsRzA80v.png"><p><em><span>杜尚《泉》</span></em></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhWWGaSbLr0-oCYYp-LT7h1Dpx-w.png"><p><em><span>安迪·沃霍尔 《金宝汤罐头》</span></em></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FizHMwKibhSddU1CnDTxVVvPObXf.png"><p><em><span>埃格尔斯顿 （William Eggleston）作品</span></em></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkfkRvEHBlZi-pBADMhOZ-gsDDY6.jpg"><p><em><span>尤尔根·泰勒（Juergen Teller）为W Magazine拍摄的Steve Yeun，比老郭拍得还丑</span></em></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2172">36:12</a> 美是明文的，但丑是加密的</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrZjC8l0OEVd1wT4FHz7adYZoGZY.png"><p><em><span>皮埃尔·布迪厄‌（Pierre Bourdieu）《‌区隔：判断力的社会批判‌》</span></em></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2415">40:15</a> 空间恐怖谷效应</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2549">42:29</a> 马克·费舍 《怪异与阴森》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fno5avGIQTKILfgXlDdGYCcx6z_Y.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2705">45:05</a> 格雷戈尔·施耐德（Gregor Schneider）《Haus u r》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvfIp8QytWaR6KwF-3eiQ6TJF_-T.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrCR6EoSktaV7HUvI32KD8bPHfS9.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2945">49:05</a> Prada的制服迷恋</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62dd2b13493ff31b082e7662/ln2SjRjIA7KgO3IlLPHjOdqMLeX4.m4a" length="53200184" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:54:46</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqehQsvppYn8lP6VoNYYJJgqW4FM.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
