  <item>
    <title>DS004：秀场音乐，从入门到精通（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6491917b86eb9d7e47d161fd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6491917b86eb9d7e47d161fd</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Jun 2023 11:46:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>因为两位嘉宾们聊high了，所以本期节目从一集扩容到了两集！</span></p><span></span><p><span>两位时装与音乐双修的全才嘉宾：音乐制作人Kurt（豆瓣ID：kurttheripprt），和最近沉迷买碟的莎莎（微博：莎老师Sarah），持续强势输出。怎么回事，聊得比上集还要精彩！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a> 秀场音乐界唯一的哥，老佛爷Karl Lagerfeld御用音乐总监：Michel Gaubert</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">3:40</a> 6万张CD，5万张黑胶，十几个AirPods，顶尖音乐总监的自我修养</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="317">5:17</a> 懂王Raf Simons，拖延症Phoebe Philo，不同设计师定秀场音乐的方式大不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="403">6:43</a> 为了Fendi长城大秀开阔壮丽的景色连夜修改秀场音乐 （Kurt个人觉得很难听，不代表本节目观点）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">9:43</a> 绝大多数的秀场音乐还是用现成音乐制作而成的，除非你像LV一样有钱，或者像Balenciaga一样有情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="852">14:12</a> 重大利好：DJ出身的音乐人对于掌控现场氛围有天然优势，退休DJ再就业又添出路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> Lemaire设计师本人和音乐总监Pilooski曾是背靠背DJ的兄弟，偷摸着在爱马仕秀上放过Suicide</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1292">21:32</a> Lemaire其实私下狂爱J Dilla，他听过的神秘歌曲居然连Madlib都没听过</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1631">27:11</a> 在火车站举办的Lemaire 20FW大秀，从音乐到秀场都充满电影感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1968">32:48</a> Lemaire 23SS邀请音乐人Ana Roxanne现场表演，声音空灵，非常梦幻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2347">39:07</a> 如果Lemaire来中国挑音乐人当品牌挚友，你会推荐谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2642">44:02</a> 图书馆音乐（library music)是失败者音乐收容所吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2853">47:33</a> Thom Yorke帮rag&amp;bone和Undercover做秀场音乐，把Creep变慢100倍算艺术吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3226">53:46</a> 成为音乐总监的成功三要素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3371">56:11</a> 秀场音乐是挖掘新音乐的捷径</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4368">1:12:48</a> fruity shop会成为更适合中国宝宝体质的Maison Kitsuné 吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4589">1:16:29</a> 一人说一场音乐最让人印象深刻的秀</span></p><span></span><p><span>Music cues:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> Fendi 08 Great Wall mix</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1239">20:39</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1292">21:32</a> Hermes 14SS Suicide - &nbsp;Girl</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1778">29:38</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1897">31:37</a> Lemaire 20FW Vince Taylor - Rock n Roll Station / Vanishing Twin - Eggs</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2028">33:48</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2095">34:55</a> LemaIre 23SS Ana Roxanne - I’m Every Sparkly Woman</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2395">39:55</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> Knopha - Gym A</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2990">49:50</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3036">50:36</a> Undercover 21FW Thom Yorke - Creep</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3073">51:13</a> - &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3147">52:27</a> Rag &amp; Bone 15FW Music by Thom Yorke</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3484">58:04</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3554">59:14</a> Dries Van Noten 20FW Michelle Gurevich - Party Girl</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3665">61:05</a> Lemaire 22SS Broadcast - Tender Buttons</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3782">63:02</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3863">64:23</a> Dior Homme 0and 07AW These New Puritans - Navigate</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4740">79:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4860">81:00</a> Ami 23FW Aksumi - Fleeting Future, Moses Sumney - Doomed (Live)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5061">84:21</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5110">85:10</a> Amiri 23AW Nas - N.Y State of Mind (Feat. DJ Premier)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5215">86:55</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5300">88:20</a> Celine 21 The Loom - Time Slip</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lg64_hXDdeMr5d1FNdzRKxl1Rr0U.m4a" length="86147329" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:28:06</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqehQsvppYn8lP6VoNYYJJgqW4FM.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>DS004：秀场音乐，从入门到精通（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/641442c28aca9099d79c95a9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">641442c28aca9099d79c95a9</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 17 Mar 2023 10:36:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>万众期待的秀场音乐特辑终于来了！</span></p><p><span>本期节目特地邀请来两位时装与音乐双修的全才嘉宾：音乐制作人Kurt（豆瓣ID：kurttheripprt），和最近沉迷买碟的莎莎（微博：莎老师Sarah），为大家详细拆解秀场音乐里的门道，从选曲秘辛到边角八卦，你感兴趣的方方面面，他们都知道！</span></p><p><span>只要你热爱时装或者音乐，那么就有99%的可能性会享受这期节目。Enjoy！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> 时装品牌的秀场音乐是谁来定的？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="295">04:55</a> 疫情之后的秀反而更好看了？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">06:10</a> Louis Vuitton FW22 Men, Arthur Verocai和Tyler, the Creator带来巴西味儿溢出的华丽弦乐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="641">10:41</a> Louis Vuitton FW23 男装引入客座设计师Colm Dillane，思维方式“莞莞类卿”，非常Virgil</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="862">14:22</a> Louis Vuitton FW23 男装秀上Rosalía的演出酣畅淋漓，像演唱会+Sleep No More</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="964">16:04</a> 热烈的拉美音乐为什么会在崇尚冷淡的时尚圈获得青睐？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1214">20:14</a> 为什么秀场偏爱Techno / Rock，而Funk / Soul / Hip Hop / House却“像山东媳妇上不了台面”？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1384">23:04</a> Off-White FW22，Virgil请来底特律著名Techno DJ Jeff Mills坐镇</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a> Louis Vuitton SS23阿那亚大秀邀请了国内乐队Sleeping Dogs——一支能演出正宗巴西味儿的老北京乐队</span></p><p><span>（PS：我们通过友人向Sleeping Dogs求证得知，是在LV男装音乐与声音总监Benji B的力荐之下才有了这次合作）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1945">32:25</a> 时装圈最有名的音乐发烧友：Raf Simons</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2009">33:29</a> Prada FW23 Men选用了池田亮司的音乐，极致minimal</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2149">35:49</a> Richie Hawtin（aka. Plastikman）与Raf Simons的壁花男孩友谊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2307">38:27</a> Richie Hawtin为Prada FW21制作的音乐强调重复与沉浸</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2436">40:36</a> Raf Simons个人同名品牌对音乐的引述会不会太直给了一点？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2613">43:33</a> 不会吧不会吧，不会有人不喜欢David Bowie吧？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2776">46:16</a> Maison Martin Margiela FW89，让时装摆脱肤浅骂名的一场秀。拼贴感极强的秀场音乐来自Frédéric Sanchez制作的mix。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3124">52:04</a> 安特卫普，很亚</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> 即便是Dries Van Noten，也难逃爱上David Bowie的宿命</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3459">57:39</a> Dries Van Noten用Kylie Minogue为整个安特卫普的时髦人士注入脑虫</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3650">1:00:50</a> Dries Van Noten FW21选用了Massive Attack的歌，音乐与衣服、舞者三位一体，极度刺激消费欲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4073">1:07:53</a> 彩蛋：Dries Van Noten的葬礼上居然想放这首歌？？！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltQmoESvJMSkBjKOtaq8tj8JnZ-5.m4a" length="68654303" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:10:10</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqehQsvppYn8lP6VoNYYJJgqW4FM.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>DS003：年度时尚盘点 | 2022再也不见</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63de29cc0d7e8eaa72ebb731</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63de29cc0d7e8eaa72ebb731</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 04 Feb 2023 09:47:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一期气氛欢乐、质地湿润</span><em><span>（就是干货没平时多的意思）</span></em><span>的年终盘点节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2022着实是吊诡的一年，但仔细盘点盘点时尚圈还是发生了不少大事儿的，一起跟着jiazhi和老郭一起回溯一下8~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="86">01:26</a> 最让人印象深刻的流行趋势之Miu Miu 露胃</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkAT4aQ48ye_5JP38TZ6t-hgl_ps.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Nicole Kidman穿露胃装</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flg86VakIyOSekvgom2rHFrYqANW.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="541">9:01</a> Nicole Kidman给The Perfect Magazine拍的大片，完美到像人类的原型</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgRhqQ7QTSXwfnw25xdRcGnXhSAb.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="663">11:03</a> 末日幻想是不是快过去了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1094">18:14</a> 2022最精彩的秀场之Y/Project 2022 Fall</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FltNcvZg5W-OpiOvnXbj5JTAqGMR.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkV476vNCwn4TzoCf_v4YUA9Ih_C.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1201">20:01</a> jiazhi买的那件毛衣+巴拉克拉法帽</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqpkmqHIxBBm97FDzelM0oF90e3s.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1262">21:02</a> Glenn Martens为JPG设计的高定</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvbVXG3cAm6FNPNYHnWoZ4mH1Hzu.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn-NhESC0CIjRUwC2NwND06v3R6t.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1463">24:23</a> Coperni喷出来的裙子</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm-PVA7397oQMH3VpuqofI9yUxLa.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1736">28:56</a> 最丑绝人寰趋势：Moon Boots</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnuZssF_-s-yl27Jn7KyY14TVk8q.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1955">32:35</a> Diesel的logo</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn9-gUJFEwZcCnhftEzPsMO6G1iw.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1977">32:57</a> 最江郎才尽设计师之Alessandro Michele</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2067">34:27</a> Demna是不是也要过气了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2196">36:36</a> 时尚圈大事件之Tik Tok的兴起，让一大堆以-core结尾的微趋势诞生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2757">45:57</a> 时尚的本质在于消耗，这样的行业能环保得了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3295">54:55</a> Ye的陨落</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3401">56:41</a> 2022离开的巨匠</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mugler yyds</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh6IT_Te-59e4koB-b7EhpIUWGoh.webp"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrLjlh2HE8BSqn7ubvPFFK4A1aL7.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Issey Miyake：Origami</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgdpzETcLtUjhveTgV5VGd7HmB6c.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Vivienne Westwood</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqZq8SISXAdAm31ZqfQ_4kxeAh7o.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3564">59:24</a> 2022买到的最满意的时尚单品之——</span></p><span></span><p><span>老郭的Diesel牛仔裤</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpbgWleWvZpfnT1TpCoeQ_3Fy7pa.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>jiazhi的bad binch tongtong圆盘裙和Rick Owens希腊女神裙</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsmPu1L_1ah6NeWX3J6GttwomD-a.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgW7Qm-DOBKWas3mDPNfbD0bbfIB.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3693">1:01:33</a> 2022小红书时尚之老钱风/财阀千金风/美式校园甜心风/时髦知识分子风</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4143">1:09:03</a> 超敏感话题之文化挪用</span></p>]]></description>
