  <item>
    <title>DS002：LV男装下任创意总监，这次会议上必须得定下来！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63188b4643274df80456d033</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63188b4643274df80456d033</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 07 Sep 2022 12:15:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>自从Virgil Abloh悲剧性的逝世之后，LV男装创意总监的位置至今空缺。整个行业都在讨论：这个如此关键的位置要由谁来接任？jiazhi_和老郭在这一期中就化身为编外HR，继任人选这次会议上必须得定下来！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎关注“DeepSurface深度肤浅”企鹅号，配套推送文章中含有本期节目的视觉辅助材料，能帮助大家更好理解节目内容。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">2:30</a> “3%理论”究竟成立吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="512">8:32</a> “3%理论”的本质是受建筑师Rem Koolhaas启发的迭代理论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="636">10:36</a> 苹果的产品更新换代也是一种3%迭代</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> Louis Vuitton 2019春夏男装：如此美国的《绿野仙踪》攻占欧洲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a> Louis Vuitton 2019秋冬男装：设计英雄们也不过是在致敬自己的设计英雄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1167">19:27</a> 为什么在入主LV之后，Virgil才开始强调种族议题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1323">22:03</a> Pyrex23：想发财，要么打篮球，要么绝命毒师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1424">23:44</a> Louis Vuitton 2019秋冬男装：马格利特+《楚门的世界》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a> Louis Vuitton 2021秋冬男装：留下文化遗产</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2190">36:30</a> 老郭暴言：这几个造型，只有建筑师才看得懂！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2505">41:45</a> Virgil Was Here：游客还是纯粹主义者？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2774">46:14</a> 第一位候选人：Martine Rose</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2964">49:24</a> 从政治正确角度，Martine Rose堪称完美人选</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3090">51:30</a> 在伦敦亚文化最繁盛的时期长大是什么体验？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3226">53:46</a> 用高级时装手法做带有工人阶级机油味儿的衣服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3407">56:47</a> Martine Rose的爱情故事：从天而降的油漆工老公</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3503">58:23</a> Martine Rose的足球衣狂热</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3641">1:00:41</a> 嚣张中带着点怂：“可能是世界上最好的设计师”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4026">1:07:06</a> Martine Rose曾经帮助Demna建立Balenciaga男装雏形</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4329">1:12:09</a> 英国陶渊明Martine Rose的性格会不会太与世无争了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4597">1:16:37</a> Virgil的导师Ye会接手吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4763">1:19:23</a> 其他被网友提名的人选</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpg-pwHkOvq8FXWTWRaPe08tfXfm.m4a" length="93146777" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:35:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqehQsvppYn8lP6VoNYYJJgqW4FM.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>DS001：Demna是Balenciaga的转世灵童吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62dd3568fa15142e17251f4d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62dd3568fa15142e17251f4d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 24 Jul 2022 12:04:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>可能是最好的中文时尚播客</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目关注于刚刚结束不久的Balenciaga Fall 2022 Couture，搭配大秀视频一起服食会更加美味。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">6:20</a> 排他又极端浪费的高定对我们这个年代来说是个有些过时的概念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> 从头包到脚的造型，是BDSM还是激进的极简主义？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="956">15:56</a> 有历史传承的时装屋寻找继任者，简直像活佛转世</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1066">17:46</a> 遮盖是和裸露同样挑衅的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1207">20:07</a> Demna的末世幻想对应建筑领域中从现代到后现代的过渡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1494">24:54</a> 和B&amp;O合作的音响手袋，是以工业设计为终点才会设计出来的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1694">28:14</a> 当代性就是从“花几十万，买只穿一次的衣服”到“花几十万，买能穿几次的衣服”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1838">30:38</a> Demna的标志性手法其实某种意义上来说非常达达主义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2232">37:12</a> 下半场秀回归高定传统，Demna非常认真地研究了archive（历史存档）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2522">42:02</a> 对于廓形的创新是Balenciaga老先生被同时代其他设计师奉为大师的理由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2642">44:02</a> 俘获所有时尚杂志，但统共卖出去两条的信封裙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2865">47:45</a> Balenciaga比Dior更早做New Look？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3077">51:17</a> 压轴的三条大裙子，出现大型秀场事故，但小红书上却说是故意的?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3250">54:10</a> 裙子替代身体成为唯一的尺度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3450">57:30</a> BFRND宣布亚文化已死</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3769">1:02:49</a> Balenciaga御用建筑事务所sub</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljPlxSId5j5HJlKg5lbsRag5gELT.m4a" length="67569327" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:09:37</itunes:duration>
